# Build context for infra/docker/*.Dockerfile (context = repository root).
# Keep secrets, local state and host build output out of every image layer.

# Secrets / local configuration (only the documented example may enter the context)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*

# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image from the lockfile
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/.build
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# Local runtime state
**/storage
**/*.log
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# VCS, CI, editor and OS noise (macOS AppleDouble files on external volumes included)
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/._*

# Not needed to build images
docs
docker
infra/webhook-receiver
README.md
docker-compose*.yml
